 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. PRT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  D   PIC X(6).
 01  T   PIC 9(8).
 01  L.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(5) VALUE "LINE ".
     05  L-N     PIC ZZ9.
 01  N   PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     ACCEPT D FROM DATE.
     ACCEPT T FROM TIME.
     DISPLAY "D " D.
     DISPLAY "T " T.
     MOVE N TO L-N.
     DISPLAY L UPON PRINTER.
     DISPLAY "HELLO PRINTER" UPON PRINTER.
     DISPLAY N UPON PRINTER.
     DISPLAY "DONE".
     STOP RUN.
